The Identify function assessment revealed significant gaps, with 3 subcategories marked as 'Not Addressed' and 1 marked as 'Partially Addressed.' Critical gaps exist in establishing formal policies for asset management, access control, and identification/authentication. Key recommendations include immediately developing policies for Asset Management (ID.AM-7) and Access Control (ID.AM-8), and addressing the need for comprehensive policies across all out-of-scope areas. Required policy documents include Acceptable Use, Access Control, Account Management, Identification/Authentication, Information Security, and Security Assessment/Authorization policies.

