  - Implement a formal Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management (C-SCRM) program, including pre-engagement due diligence and supplier offboarding procedures.
  - Immediately mandate encryption for all data-at-rest locations and establish robust key management controls to resolve data protection gaps.
  - Develop formal policies for Asset Management, Access Control, and Identification/Authentication to establish foundational security controls.
  - Establish comprehensive policies for System and Communications Protection and Incident Response to address all out-of-scope requirements.

