Executive Summary:
The Identify function assessment revealed significant gaps, with 3 subcategories being entirely unaddressed and 17 being out of scope. The most critical gaps involve the lack of policies for Access Control (ID.AM-8), Assessment of Policy Compliance (ID.RA-07), and Identification and Authentication (ID.RA-10). Key recommendations include immediately developing policies for Asset Management procedures, data discovery, and integrating necessary controls for the out-of-scope areas. To achieve maturity, the organization must establish foundational policies covering Asset Management, Access Control, and Information Classification.

